#: psynet/templates/consents/audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-title"
msgid ""
"For example, you may be asked to record your finger-tapping in response to a"
" sound or video, or to record yourself speaking or singing."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-title"
msgid ""
"In this experiment, you may be asked to make a voice or video recording."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid "(Please tick where applicable)"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid "Addendum for demonstrations"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"I agree that my <i>audiovisual</i> recordings can be used for demonstration "
"purposes in presentations with a limited number of participants (e.g., "
"teaching courses or scientific presentations)."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid "NO"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid "YES"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"By making recording people while moving, singing, tapping to rhythms, or "
"speaking, we can infer the mechanisms of the auditory and visual systems."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"For example, we would like to understand how predictive mechanisms in "
"perception rely on experience, learning, and memory."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid "I agree to the handling of the recordings as described above."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid "I had sufficient time for this decision."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"I have been informed that the storage and processing of the "
"<i>audiovisual</i> recording will be carried out in pseudonymized form, "
"i.e., using a number and without containing my name, and that there is a "
"coding list that links my name to the number."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"I have read and understood everything and hereby agree that "
"<i>audiovisual</i> recordings of me may be taken."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid "I have received a copy of this consent form."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"I have received oral and written information about the fact that "
"<i>audiovisual</i> recordings will be made in this study."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid "I may withdraw my consent at any time."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"In case of refusal or withdrawal, no costs will be incurred nor will there "
"be other negative consequences; however, in this case, participation in the "
"study will not be possible."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"Researchers associated with this project will have access to my "
"<i>audiovisual</i> data during the recording and the analysis of the "
"material."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"The declaration of consent for <i>audiovisual</i> recordings is voluntary."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"The investigators are the only persons who have access to this coding list, "
"which will be destroyed after completion of the research project."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-audiovisual"
msgid ""
"The recording serves the purpose of understanding how humans perceive and "
"process information from sound and visual."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-title"
msgid "Research Participant Consent Form for Image/Sound Recordings"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"I understand that I am free to withdraw my consent to the collection and "
"storage of my personal data without negative consequences."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid "Investigator"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_audiovisual_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid "Title of study:"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid ""
"After completion of the research project, the coding list will be destroyed."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid ""
"From this point on, my data are anonymous, which means that they cannot be "
"linked to my person any longer."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid ""
"However, if the coding list has already been destroyed, it will no longer be"
" possible to identify and thus to delete my data set."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid ""
"I agree to the described collecting and processing of my age, gender, and "
"country of birth."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid ""
"I have been informed that I may request deletion of all my data at any time."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid "I have read and understood all of the information completely."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid ""
"I have received a copy of the participant information sheet and of the "
"consent form."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid ""
"I have received written information about the study and the procedure of the"
" study."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid ""
"If I had questions concerning the upcoming study, they were answered "
"completely and to my satisfaction."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid ""
"The investigators are the only persons who have access to this coding list "
"and who are thus able to link the collected data to my name."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid ""
"The participant information sheet about the examination is part of this "
"consent form."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid ""
"The recording and processing of these data are carried out in pseudonymized "
"form by means of a code and do not contain my name."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-cap"
msgid "There is a coding list on paper that links my name to this number."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/cap-recruiter_standard_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-title"
msgid "Research Participant Consent Form"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"If you have further questions regarding the General Data Protection "
"Regulation in the context of personal data being processed in our studies, "
"please contact the Data Protection Officer of the Max Planck Society:"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-data"
msgid ""
"If we invite you to participate in a study, we will store the date and time "
"of this communication."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-data"
msgid ""
"If you agree to participate, we also will store the date and time of your "
"communication of this choice, and whether you completed the experiment "
"successfully or not."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-data"
msgid ""
"In addition to your contact details (i.e., name and email) and the "
"demographic data requested in the log in (i.e., age, gender, and "
"nationality), we also store the date and time when you made the entry."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-data"
msgid ""
"In addition, we save the date and time when you verified your email address."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-data"
msgid ""
"Of course, before you participate in a study, you will be informed in detail"
" about the procedure of the study and the collection of data during the "
"study."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-data"
msgid "Which Data are stored"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-data"
msgid ""
"Your consent to participate in a study will be obtained separately for each "
"study you participate in."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-database"
msgid ""
"In addition, we would like to inform you about your rights with regard to "
"the processing of personal data."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-database"
msgid ""
"With this privacy policy, we would like to inform you about the personal "
"data we collect when you register for our participant pool and for what "
"purposes we process this data."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-duration"
msgid "Duration of Data Storage"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-duration"
msgid ""
"Note that all information, including the experiment and payment history will"
" be removed from our database."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-duration"
msgid "To do so, send an e-mail with the subject “Delete” to:"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-duration"
msgid ""
"You can also delete your data from the database by deleting your account "
"(i.e., press 'Delete account'  in the cap-recruiter log-in page)."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-duration"
msgid "You may request the deletion of your data at any time."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-duration"
msgid ""
"Your data will be stored in the contact database for as long as the purpose "
"of such storage, i.e., to contact you about participating in a study, "
"remains in effect."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-duration"
msgid "Your personal data will then be deleted immediately."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-payment"
msgid ""
"Based on this information we allow you to receive payment via an external "
"system such as PayPAL/WISE."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-payment"
msgid ""
"However we do store completion records and payment details of every task you"
" completed."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-payment"
msgid ""
"If you cannot or would not like to receive payment via this system, we would"
" not be able to pay you, however you can still participate in our "
"experiments voluntarily, without payment."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-payment"
msgid "In this case you will not receive any compensation for your time."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-payment"
msgid ""
"It is your responsibility to make sure you can receive payment through this "
"system and that you would want to consent to use it."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-payment"
msgid "Payment and Compensation"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-payment"
msgid ""
"This information will be available for you to review it when you login to "
"the database."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-payment"
msgid ""
"This system supports transferring money to most banks around the world, "
"please search your bank in their website to ensure that you will be able to "
"receive payment prior to taking part in our experiments."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-payment"
msgid ""
"We also recommend checking the term of service and it’s privacy statement "
"and see if you consent to use their system for payment."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-payment"
msgid ""
"We will not store any banking information or payment information in our "
"system."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid "Access (GDPR art. 15)"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid ""
"As a data subject whose personal data are processed with regard to your "
"participation in our studies, you have the following rights in principle and"
" insofar as no legal exceptions apply in individual cases:"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid "Data Protection: Rights of Data Subjects"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid "Data portability (GDPR art. 20)"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid "Erasure (GDPR art. 17, para. 1)"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid ""
"For the Max Planck Society, this is the Data Protection Authority of "
"Bavaria, Postfach 1349, 91504 Ansbach, Germany."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid ""
"If you have any questions about this research, your rights, or treatment as "
"a participant, please do not hesitate to contact the Computational Auditory "
"Perception Group at the Max Planck Institute for Empirical Aesthetics:"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid ""
"In order to ensure transparency with regard to the processing of personal "
"data, the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) of the European Union "
"provides information about the rights of data subjects."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid "Rectification (GDPR art. 16)"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid "Restriction of processing (GDPR art. 18)"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid ""
"Right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority (GDPR art. 77)."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid "Withdrawal of consent (GDPR art. 7, para. 3)"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-protection"
msgid ""
"You may also address your inquiries directly to the Max Planck Institute for"
" Empirical Aesthetics:"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid "Purposes of Processing"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid "This data will never be shared with third parties."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"We store and process your data only for the purpose of initiating "
"communication with you and for planning studies at the Max Planck Institute "
"for Empirical Aesthetics (MPIEA)."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"All connections between your computer and the web server are encrypted."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"The data entered in the form you fill out are transferred in encrypted form "
"to an internal server."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"We take all necessary technical and organizational security measures to "
"protect your personal data from loss and abuse."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"We will then send you an e-mail with a confirmation link to verify your "
"e-mail address."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Your data are stored in a secure operating environment that is not "
"accessible to the public."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/lucid_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-title"
msgid "We need your consent to proceed"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/database_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid "Security"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
msgid "per hour"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"If you satisfactorily complete the study, we compensate you for your "
"participation:"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "We appreciate your contribution to science!"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"You may also receive an additional payment based on your performance in the "
"task."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid ""
"The purpose of this project is to study how people from different places in "
"the world experience sounds (e.g., speech, music) and images (e.g., faces, "
"color)."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Confidentiality"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "Compensation"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid ""
"Although it may not directly benefit you, this study may benefit society by "
"helping us understanding how humans derive information from sound and "
"vision, and potentially to help engineer machines that can replicate our "
"abilities (e.g. in sound recognition and computer vision) and to help "
"improve perceptual abilities in people whose hearing or sight is impaired."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-benefits"
msgid "Benefits"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"For the purpose of helping scientific progress and replication, sometimes we"
" may share the data with research collaborators."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid ""
"In these cases, we will only share fully anonymized data, such as "
"demographic, aggregated, or extracted data without any personal identifiers."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-collaborations"
msgid "Research collaborations"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"All of the information we obtain during the research will be kept "
"confidential."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Although researchers will not use your alpha numeric code to derive your "
"real identity, this record could be linked in some cases to your public "
"profile page if a data breach takes place."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Consenting to these additional requirements is also fully voluntary."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"If an experiment is collecting data that cannot be fully anonymized, we will"
" inform you and also ask for additional consent."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"No personal identifiers (e.g. your name or contact data) will be collected "
"or used at any stage of the experiment."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"These include experiments where we make audio-visual recordings or where we "
"need your contact details to contact you in the future to take another "
"experiment."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"This code will not be used to derive your real identity, will not be shared "
"with anyone outside of the research team and will be deleted after use."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid "Thus, the experimental data is anonymous."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Thus, you may wish to restrict what information you choose to share "
"publicly."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We may collect some demographic data (e.g. age, gender, country of "
"residence) as well as information about your learning and exposure history "
"(e.g. musical experience playing an instrument, years of formal education, "
"languages spoken)."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"We will only save your anonymized alpha numeric code in our system, in order"
" to distinguish participants who have already taken part in this or other "
"experiments."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Finally, in some experiments you may be asked to make a voice or video "
"recording, for example, you may be asked to record your finger-tapping in "
"response to a sound or video, or to record yourself speaking or singing."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"For example, you may be asked to judge how pleasant a particular sound or an"
" image is, or to categorize sounds or images (e.g., if a sound or an image "
"is that of a car or a cow), or to judge other basic features of sounds or "
"images (e.g., how frequently do you encounter this type of sound or image? "
"how aesthetically pleasing you consider a particular sound or image?)."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If the experiment will contain these elements we will ask for an additional "
"consent."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"If you volunteer to participate in this study, you will be asked to perform "
"simple tasks using your keyboard or mouse while listening to sounds, or "
"while observing images or videos."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"In some experiments, we may use mild deception, i.e., we may not explain the"
" full truth regarding an experimental task (for example we will not tell you"
" that an image was generated by an artificial computer system and not a "
"human)."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"Mild deception will only be used in some experiments where we need to "
"prevent biasing the participants before taking the experiment."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid "Procedure"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-procedure"
msgid ""
"The specific sounds, images, and videos used will vary, but may include: "
"recordings of ambient sounds, noise-bursts, speech, music, simple tones, "
"naturalistic images, animated images, comics, faces, objects, geometric "
"shapes, fractal images, or videos of natural environments."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-purpose"
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid "For the Max-Planck-Society, this is:"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"Note that in some studies data deletion will not be possible, in this case "
"we will ask you specifically to consent to this procedure in a separate "
"consent form."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You also have the right to submit an objection to the supervisory authority."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid ""
"You have the right to information regarding the data relating to you that is"
" stored at the Max-Planck-Institute, the right to correct inaccurate data, "
"and the right to demand the deletion of data in cases of inadmissible data "
"storage and the right to data portability."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-rights"
msgid "Your rights"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-risks"
msgid "Risks/Discomforts"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-risks"
msgid ""
"There are no risks for participating in this study beyond those associated "
"with normal computer use."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Data will be stored temporarily on external servers and desktops/laptops "
"that are password protected."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid "No data will be stored permanently on external servers."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"The data will be then stored permanently in the institute servers with hard "
"disks encrypted using industry-standard encryption software."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"The investigator may withdraw you from this research if circumstances arise "
"which warrant doing so."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid "Voluntary participation"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"You are free to discontinue participation in this study at any time without "
"penalty."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid ""
"You are free to refuse to take part, and you may stop taking part at any "
"time."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/main_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-voluntary"
msgid "Your participation in this research is voluntary."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"Following open science practices to improve science reusability and "
"replicability, we may want to publish the dataset collected in this "
"experiment as soon as the study is finished."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"This includes audio-visual recordings, such as a recording of your finger-"
"tapping in response to a sound or video, or to record yourself speaking or "
"singing."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
msgctxt "consent"
msgid ""
"We may also want to publish certain materials as part of the scientific "
"publication, such as a demo video of the task or part of an interview."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"However, your data will not be directly associated with your name or other "
"identifiers in any way (we will not specify your name when presenting "
"audio/video materials of yours)."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-confidentiality"
msgid ""
"Since the audio-visual recordings collected in this experiment may be made "
"public, we cannot guarantee anonymity of your data if you participate in "
"this experiment."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid ""
"Although your data will not be associated with personal identifiers, it is "
"possible to link your personal information based on audio-visual recordings"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid ""
"By consenting to this experiment you are committing not to use profanity "
"while recording audio or nudity while recording video."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid "Disclaimer"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid ""
"Since some materials will be published as part of the scientific "
"publication, you will not be able to delete such materials, as they will "
"become public (either immediately or soon after data collection)."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-disclaimer"
msgid ""
"Thus, you may wish to make sure you do not record any materials you do not "
"want to make public."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/open_science_consent.html
msgctxt "consent-security"
msgid ""
"Data will be published on open science frameworks/websites such as OSF "
"(https://osf.io/) and will be available to everybody with internet access."
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid "By doing the task you are helping science, thank you!"
msgstr ""

#: psynet/templates/consents/voluntary_with_no_compensation_consent.html
#: psynet/templates/macros/consent.html
msgctxt "consent-compensation"
msgid ""
"This study is completely voluntary; you will not receive any monetary "
"compensation for participation."
msgstr ""

